<%- include('partials/head',{title:settings.business_name+' — '+settings.tagline}) %><%- include('partials/header') %><main><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Creative studio · Davao City</div><h1>Make your brand worth remembering.</h1><p>We design brands, websites, and digital campaigns for ambitious businesses that want clearer positioning and better customer journeys.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/booking"><%= settings.primary_cta %></a><a class="btn alt" href="/work">View Our Work</a></div></div><div class="hero-art"></div></div></section><div class="trust"><div class="container">A fictional sample brand built to demonstrate a complete agency-grade website and CMS.</div></div><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">What we do</div><h2>Strategy with something to show for it.</h2></div><p>Every engagement starts with the customer, the business goal, and the clearest next action.</p></div><div class="services"><% services.forEach((s,i)=>{ %><article class="service"><div class="service-num">0<%= i+1 %></div><h3><%= s.name %></h3><p><%= s.description %></p><a href="/services/<%= s.slug %>"><%= s.cta %> →</a></article><% }) %></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">The approach</div><h2>Less noise. More intention.</h2></div><div><p>Instead of stacking trends on top of a template, Lumina connects positioning, content, UX, and technology into one coherent experience.</p><a class="btn" href="/about">Meet the studio</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Process</div><h2>From first question to launch.</h2></div></div><div class="process"><div class="step"><strong>01</strong><h3>Discover</h3><p>Clarify audience, offer, constraints, and the business outcome.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>02</strong><h3>Strategize</h3><p>Turn insights into positioning, structure, and a conversion path.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>03</strong><h3>Design</h3><p>Shape the visual system and interactions around the strategy.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>04</strong><h3>Launch</h3><p>Build, test, optimize, and prepare the experience for growth.</p></div></div></div></section><% if(posts.length){ %><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Insights</div><h2>Ideas worth keeping.</h2></div><a href="/blog">View all →</a></div><div class="posts"><% posts.forEach(p=>{ %><article class="post-card"><div class="post-body"><div class="eyebrow"><%= p.category %></div><h3><a href="/blog/<%= p.slug %>"><%= p.title %></a></h3><p><%= p.excerpt %></p></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section><% } %><section class="cta"><div class="container"><div class="cta-box"><div class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</div><h2>Have a good business. Give it a better digital home.</h2><p>Tell us what you're building, what is not working, and what success should look like.</p><a class="btn" href="/booking"><%= settings.primary_cta %></a></div></div></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>